   {
    "text": "GTA 6 has an ability a lot of players never use. Focus."
   },
   {
    "text": "Click both sticks at once. L3 and R3, or LS and RS on Xbox."
   },
   {
    "text": "It highlights weak spots, like enemy body parts, engines and tires."
   },
   {
    "text": "It also marks cops and valuables. Watch the purple eye meter in the corner."
   },
   {
    "text": "Did you know about Focus? Follow for more GTA 6 tips."
   }
  ]
